  "summary": "Malicious code in eslint-rxjs (npm)",
  "details": "The package's postinstall hook executes a function that makes an HTTP request to an ngrok tunnel endpoint (hxxps://e493-95-216-46-122[.]ngrok-free[.]app/ping) on every install, beaconing to an attacker-controlled tunnel to confirm the package was installed. The package name combines two popular packages (eslint, rxjs) and its metadata is unrelated to its actual function.",
